{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":40,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"72a3aef0-2660-4ce2-b3bc-5ef74b14f4d6","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190843863,"PostDateInt":1785373115000,"PostDate":"2026-07-30T08:58:35","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"主计划经理(J12620)","OrgId":700097377,"Org":"中山工厂","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·中山市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、需求预测管理：对接前端销售预测，跟踪业务需求变化，分析销售预测及需求趋势，制定主计划调整方案。\n2、MPS主计划统筹：根据供需平衡，负责工厂MPS主计划编制，输出产能需求计划和关键原材料的备货计划。并通过动态排产与大订单的全流程交付管控，保障订单准时交付；\n3、交付策略搭建：结合产品线特点，制定交付策略，不断优化交付周期，提升交付效率。\n4、订单交付管控：全流程统筹订单评审、排产、入库跟进，处理交付异常与改机需求，输出订单跟进报表。\n5、数字化改善：协同推动计划数字化改善，提升计划管理效率。","Require":"1、8年以上大型制造业或工控行业制造计划工作经验，其中至少3年以上主计划经验；\n2、熟悉“小批量、多品种、定制化”生产计划管理流程，运作模式及特点；\n3、熟悉主生产计划、物料需求计划、S&OP产销协同流程；\n4、良好的库存管控、订单交付管理、数据分析能力；\n5、良好的统筹推动力、跨部门拉通与资源协调能力，敢于主动发声；\n6、较强抗压能力，高度敬业精神及自驱力，乐观、有激情。","ClassificationOne":"供应链类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-07-30T08:58:35","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"R