学本科及以上学历，计算机相关专业，5年以上相关工作经验\n2.精通Vue.js框架，熟练掌握其响应式原理与常用生态工具，Vue生态工具，参与过前端组件库的建设与维护\n3.熟练掌握HTML/CSS/JavaScript，能熟练实现布局与动效，前端性能优化、浏览器兼容性处理\n4.熟练掌握WPF开发，精通XAML语言、数据绑定、触发器、样式、模板及动画系统，能编写WPF界面交互逻辑，能独立完成界面层与业务层的对接，参与过桌面端组件库的建设与维护\n5.熟悉常用算法及设计模式\n6.具备良好的沟通能力与团队协作精神，文档归纳整理能力，能主动推动界面用户体验的落地\n7.熟悉数字化业务，具备CI/CD平台相关开发经验优先\n\n软件工程师(后端)\n1.大学本科及以上学历，计算机相关专业，5年以上相关工作经验\n2.精通 C# 语言，熟练掌握 ASP.NET Core 框架，对 IOC、中间件管道、配置体系，中间件等有深入理解\n3.熟练掌握网络编程知识，精通异步编程、多线程及并发控制，能编写稳定高效的非阻塞代码\n4.熟练掌握至少一种关系型数据库，具备良好的库表设计能力和 SQL 调优经验\n5.熟练掌握Linux/Windows 操作系统 基本操作与命令，具备在 Linux/Windows 环境下排查、部署、维护 .NET 服务的实战经验\n6.了解容器化技术及编排工具，有微服务架构下的开发与治理经验者\n7.具备良好的沟通能力与团队协作精神，文档归纳整理能力，能主动推动界面用户体验的落地\n8.熟悉数字化业务，具备CI/CD平台相关开发经验优先","ClassificationOne":"研发技术类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-06-22T14:38:48","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAd